WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
An audio statement released from&nbsp;
Wagner chief Yevgeny Prigozhin not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.680
sure where he was when he released this&nbsp;
or who has checked the validity but in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:15.660
this statement he says that two factors&nbsp;
played into his decision to turn around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.700
the march to Moscow he said he wanted to&nbsp;
avoid Russian bloodshed he also said the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:27.540
march was a demonstration of protests not&nbsp;
intended to overthrow the power in Moscow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.860
he also said the aim of the March was to&nbsp;
avoid the destruction of the Wagner group

